  "ingredients": [
    "2 large eggs",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted and cooled",
    "3 tablespoons milk, or as needed",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.125 teaspoon salt",
    "3 tablespoons vegetable oil, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lwchKDXuG3D17sj8T1V8ueRozd4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139673-HomemadIceCreamCones-ddmfs-Step1-3x4-8497-692a8f4e067e47fd8aa32f0e73847941.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139673/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together eggs and sugar in a large bowl until frothy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jMQtZ1bX7mAiOoVL_dfUhlKoMU4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139673-HomemadIceCreamCones-ddmfs-Step2-3x4-8500-c3b49d54f2444be687a53c4363c5fda5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139673/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in butter, milk, and vanilla. Gradually whisk in flour and salt until smooth. The batter should be thin; you can stir in more milk if needed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RpuOfZCas7ta6OcI00P6VVcBL9Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139673-HomemadIceCreamCones-ddmfs-Step3-3x4-8502-842a67e503e344b299d72d4f50bd6bbb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139673/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a small skillet or griddle over medium heat. Brush the pan lightly with oil. Pour about 1/4 cup of batter onto the skillet and turn to spread out the batter into a thin circle. When the underside is golden brown, flip over and cook until golden on the other side. Remove from the pan and form into a cone while it's hot, squeezing the end to seal.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iZJW0-9iCTaWfKPGWdTK6DxxOhY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139673-HomemadIceCreamCones-ddmfs-Step5-3x4-8507-656a8904c6cf491eab19952f4e590ac4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/139673/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place on a wire rack to cool and harden completely. Repeat with the remaining batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nutzMHRxNY4XyGuKOlz59iidVOw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/139673-HomemadIceCreamCones-ddmfs-Step6-3x4-8509-d40f65d8dcc2434e88a28524e515bf74.jpg"
